/*
  PDFRender - object model, arena pool and lexer.

  The lexer is deliberately tolerant: real-world PDFs contain 19-byte
  xref lines, CR-only line ends, junk between objects and numbers
  like "4." or "-.5".  Anything we cannot make sense of is a clean
  error, never a crash - the module will meet hostile files.

